Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B-NInfer

This distribution is a quantised (groupwise-int, recipe qwen3_6_35b_a3b-v2),
single-file NInfer conversion combining components from four upstream works:

1. Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B-MTP (target model + distilled MTP head)
   Source: https://huggingface.co/shisa-ai/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B-MTP
   License: Apache License 2.0 (Qwen-derived MTP head and the merged
   distribution); the Ornith target weights remain subject to their upstream
   MIT license (https://huggingface.co/ornith-ai/Ornith-1.5-35B-A3B).
   Modifications: weights quantised to NInfer's groupwise-int recipe and
   repackaged into a single .ninfer artifact.

2. Qwen3.6-35B-A3B frontend resources (tokenizer, chat template, generation
   and preprocessor configs)
   Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Modifications: none; embedded verbatim (sha256-verified against the
   NInfer converter's pins).

3. Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-DFlash draft model
   Source: https://huggingface.co/z-lab/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-DFlash
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Modifications: embedded into the artifact for optional DFlash speculation.

4. NInfer converter and recipes
   Source: https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer
   (commit b2b96bae4dd88f95b9ea8126d68fae3b88caa374)
   License: Apache License 2.0

Build recipe: https://github.com/j842/ninfer-qwen-uncensored (build-ornith.sh)

